<section id="s-ptq" data-code="ptq">
<div class="section-no">04 — Post-Training Quantization</div>
<h2>PTQ: Quantize a Finished Model</h2>
<p>Post-training quantization (PTQ) compresses a fully-trained model without re-training. It's fast (minutes to hours on a 70B model), requires only a small calibration dataset, and is the dominant approach in production deployments today. The key challenge: how to minimize the accuracy loss from discarding precision that was baked into the weights during expensive training.</p>

