<section id="s-hardware" data-code="hardware">
<div class="section-no">06 — Hardware &amp; Standards</div>
<h2>FP8, FP4, and NVIDIA's Silicon Roadmap</h2>
<p>Quantization doesn't happen in a vacuum — it's co-designed with the hardware that executes the matrix multiplications. The last two GPU generations have fundamentally changed what's practical at low precision.</p>

