<section id="s-deploy" data-code="deploy">
<div class="section-no">07 — Production Guide</div>
<h2>Choosing Your Format: Accuracy, Speed, and Memory</h2>
<p>With dozens of quantization schemes available, which should you use? The answer depends on your hardware, latency target, and whether you can tolerate quality degradation. Here's a practical decision framework.</p>

